-  "Skill_1006107_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Forte Gauge</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, Hsin can gain and consume <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, Hsin can gain and consume <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Answering Form: Special Heavy Attack</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, when Answering Heart is full, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast it, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nCasting it unlocks <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Illumining Form: Special Resonance Skill</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, when Illumining Heart is full, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to cast it, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nHsin enters the <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state, and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is enhanced, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> and consuming <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Illumining Form: Special Heavy Attack</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and in the <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state, when all <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color> is consumed, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast it, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nCasting it unlocks <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation Finisher</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Mode</color></size>\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, Hsin has the <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> ability and can gain <color=Highlight>Unison</color>.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Hsin removes all <color=Highlight>Electro Rage</color> stacks from a target to gain <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color>. While casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color>, Hsin consumes <color=Highlight>Heart of Thunder</color> to deal <color=Highlight>Electro Flare</color> DMG to targets.",
