-  "Skill_1006109_MultiSkillDescribe": "Attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> equal to {0} of Hsin's ATK.\n\nHsin gains <color=Highlight>Nightglow</color> after casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation - Pillars Across Heaven</color>. \n\nWhile Hsin is in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color> consumes <color=Highlight>Nightglow</color> to grant nearby Resonators in the team other than Hsin {3} Electro DMG Amplification for {4}s.\n\nThe above effects end early when Hsin switches Resonance Mode.",
