   "Skill_1006109_SkillName": "Herself a Thousand Lanterns",
   "Skill_1006109_SkillResume": "Deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation Finisher</color> is cast, casting this skill triggers various effects depending on the <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode</color>:\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Unison</color>, Resonators in the team other than Hsin gain All DMG Amplification when they have gained <color=Highlight>Unison</color>.\n- While in <color=Highlight>Resonance Mode - Electro Flare</color>, Electro DMG dealt by Resonators in the team other than Hsin is Amplified.",
-  "Skill_1006201_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack</color></size>\nPerform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, performing up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color></size>\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack</color></size>\nConsume STA to perform Plunging Attack, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight> Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006201_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack</color></size>\nPerform up to 3 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, performing up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nHold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color>.\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 2</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack</color></size>\nConsume STA to perform Plunging Attack, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful Dodge to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight> Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a certain time after a successful <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> to attack the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>.\n- Shortly after casting the skill, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1</color>, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
   "Skill_1006201_SkillName": "Furled Canopy",
   "Skill_1006201_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, performing up to 4 consecutive attacks, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color></size>\nShortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>, hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder Stage 1 and Stage 2</color> in succession, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Mid-air Attack</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
   "Skill_1006202_SkillDescribe": "Attack targets within range, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Upon being attacked by an enemy target, cast <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to become immune to this damage and stagnate nearby targets. This <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is immune to interruption and triggers <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color>.\n- Entering the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state resets the Cooldown of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 2</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 3</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color>.",
   "Skill_1006202_SkillName": "Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver",
   "Skill_1006202_SkillResume": "Deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Upon being attacked by an enemy target, cast <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to become immune to this damage and stagnate nearby targets. This <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> is immune to interruption and triggers <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color>.\n- Entering the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state resets the Cooldown of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
-  "Skill_1006203_SkillDescribe": "While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> becomes available. Casting Resonance Liberation deals <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to targets within range.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> grants Suoming <color=Highlight>Unison</color> for {0}s, triggered only once every {1}s.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Blight Rain, Miasmic Thunder</color></size>\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color>, if Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, when the active Resonator deals damage, a <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> is summoned as a Coordinated Attack on the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Within {2}s after this damage is dealt, a <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> can be summoned each second. This effect is triggered once per second. The damage dealt by <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> does not trigger this effect.\n- Only 1 <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> can be summoned per second, up to {3} in total.\n- This effect lasts {4}s, or until the number of summoned <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> reaches the limit.",
+  "Skill_1006203_SkillDescribe": "While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> becomes available. Casting Resonance Liberation deals <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to targets within range.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> grants Suoming <color=Highlight>Unison</color> for {0}s, triggered only once every {1}s.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Blight Rain, Miasmic Thunder</color></size>\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color>, if Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, when the active Resonator deals damage, a <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> is summoned as a Coordinated Attack on the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Within {2}s after this damage is dealt, a <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> can be summoned each second. This effect is triggered once per second. The damage dealt by <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> does not trigger this effect.\n- Only 1 <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> can be summoned per second, up to {3} in total.\n- This effect lasts {4}s, or until the number of summoned <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> reaches the limit.",
