-  "Skill_1006205_SkillDescribe": "When Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and is switched out, she gains the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect for {0}s.\nWhile this effect is active, Suoming's <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color> grants the incoming Resonator {1}% Electro DMG Bonus, plus an additional {2}% for each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> they have, up to {3}%. This effect lasts for {4}s or until the Resonator is switched out.\n\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver</color> removes <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, consumes {5} points of Concerto Energy, and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>, granting the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect: the DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color> and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color> are increased by {6}%, and Suoming's Crit. DMG is increased by {7}%. This effect lasts for {8}s or until the Resonator is switched out.\n- Gaining <color=Highlight>Unison</color> ends this effect early.\n- Gaining the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect ends this effect early.\n- The <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect cannot be gained while the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect is active.\n- While the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>.",
+  "Skill_1006205_SkillDescribe": "When Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and is switched out, she gains the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect for {0}s.\nWhile this effect is active, within {1}s after Suoming casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>, Suoming's <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color> grants the incoming Resonator {2} Electro DMG Bonus, plus an additional {3} for each stack of <color=Highlight><te href=131111>Unison Boon</te></color> they have, up to {4}. This effect lasts for {5}s or until the Resonator is switched out.\n\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver</color> removes <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, consumes {6} points of Concerto Energy, and clears all <color=Highlight><te href=131201>Delusion</te></color>, granting the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect: the DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color> and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color> are increased by {7}, each stage of the skills restores {8} points of Concerto Energy on hit, and Suoming's Crit. DMG is increased by {9}. This effect lasts for {10}s or until the Resonator is switched out.\n- Gaining <color=Highlight>Unison</color> ends this effect early.\n- Gaining the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect ends this effect early.\n- The <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect cannot be gained while the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect is active.\n- While the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>.",
