+  "Term131116_Desc": "The <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> state lasts {2}s.\nWhile this state is active, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form</color> is further enhanced into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>, and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color>.\nWhen <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> and <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Illumining Form: Pillars Aligned</color> hit a target, <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color> is consumed if Hsin is the active Resonator.\nExiting <color=Highlight>Mechanism Dominion</color> clears <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</color>.",
   "Term131116_Title": "Mechanism Dominion",
