+  "Term131117_Desc": "Can hold up to {0} points of <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color>.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, when <color=Highlight>Normal Attack - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color>, <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color>, or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> hits a target, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color> if She is the active Resonator.\nCasting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Answering Form: Manifold Unison</color> grants {13} points of <color=Highlight>Answering Heart</color>.",
   "Term131117_Title": "Answering Heart",
