   "Term131119_Title": "Source Intent",
-  "Term131120_Desc": "Increases Hsin's resistance to interruption for {2}s.\nEntering the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state resets Hsin's <color=Highlight>Illumining Heart</a></color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state and in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, if <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> has not been unlocked, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Answering</color>. While in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Illumining</color>.",
